@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. 探活
GET {{base}}/

### 2. 不带身份证访问 /me
GET {{base}}/me

### 3. 注册（密码故意只写 7 位，看 422）
POST {{base}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "look001@example.com", "password": "1234567"}

### 4. 正常注册
POST {{base}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "look002@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!23"}

### 5. 登录（复制响应里的 access_token）
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "look002@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!23"}